n our trip as it was the only place that would accept a large last minute reservation for Saturday night and I am so happy we did! I went to the bar once I arrived and ordered a Louisiana Mule which was fabulous.I wish I paid more attention to what it was made with as I would love to make one for myself at home. Once we were seated we ordered a round of Oysters and my god I have NEVER seen anything like them. Up here in NY, our oysters are probably 3-4 inches on a good day, these things were MONSTERS. Quite intimidating but they were very good. I can't say I ate any of the extra large ones but I did enjoy the smaller ones that I had quite a bit. I also ordered a turtl..."},{"business_id":"OoM2j5LPJC4Mofl2XQjBvQ","review_id":"CPQhDz8rX7_ajexhemDu_Q","date":"2017-06-04T15:37:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.935499906539917,"text_excerpt":"My wife and I had a chance to experience several meals at this neat place. We would definitely recommend it for a lunch stop. The Redfish meal was very good, but highly seasoned. Not too hot for me, but my wife felt it was a little too spicy. We also ate the Cheeseburger, The Grilled Chicken salad, and the Bar-B-Que ribs, and all were very good. The club sandwich was awesome. We both enjoyed the Architectural design of the restaurant. We never felt we were hurried, and really enjoyed our meals there."},{"business_id":"OoM2j5LPJC4Mofl2XQjBvQ","review_id":"KaA_VwGdFQz63YswD1eSMg","date":"2016-02-15T20:13:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9331920742988586,"text_excerpt":"This was a really good restaurant. Cant give it a perfect score, but still a great place to eat. We went as a group of 12 and the waiter was prompt to get us our drinks and appetizers. try the alligator croquettes or chips with blue cheese dip- so good. For the main course I had the barbecue ribs, where my friends had the chicken and waffles, steak, salad, and a burger. They all looked great. The one bummer about the meal was the bread pudding- not very moist. However, the key lime pie we tried is phenomenal. Highly recommended"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OoM2j5LPJC4Mofl2XQjBvQ","photo_id":"xuGsLG20je0ywYin4Jzluw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xuGsLG20je0ywYin4Jzluw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8887572288513184},{"business_id":"OoM2j5LPJC4Mofl2XQjBvQ","photo_id":"-UVSYFqsvRcmm1yPxRgmBg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/-UVSYFqsvRcmm1yPxRgmBg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8804149627685547},{"business_id":"OoM2j5LPJC4Mofl2XQjBvQ","photo_id":"odLarkLKhZTR0nCthkOL4w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/odLarkLKhZTR0nCthkOL4w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8386322855949402},{"business_id":"OoM2j5LPJC4Mofl2XQjBvQ","photo_id":"LofIdjKVxJou8mIkCxtybA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LofIdjKVxJou8mIkCxtybA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8069677352905273},{"business_id":"OoM2j5LPJC4Mofl2XQjBvQ","photo_id":"Jb3HtH8-AeRSjYMHqD7jIw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Jb3HtH8-AeRSjYMHqD7jIw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8041782379150391}]},"notebook_case":null}
